11. CI/CD Pipeline for Attendance Application

Execution Steps
1.Upload attendance app code to GitHub
2.Create CodePipeline
3.Configure source and deployment stages
4.Connect EC2 or S3 deployment target
5.Start pipeline execution
6.Verify automatic deployment

Project Overview
Developed a CI/CD pipeline for automated deployment of an attendance management application.

AWS Services Used
AWS CodePipeline
Amazon EC2 / S3

Features
Automated deployment
Continuous delivery
Faster updates

Architecture
GitHub → CodePipeline → EC2/S3 Deployment


